 </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">无谷低敏，呵护猫咪敏感肠胃</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>99</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"16\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/mock_good.jpg\" alt=\"爱肯拿鸡肉猫粮4kg成猫幼猫通用粮\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">爱肯拿鸡肉猫粮4kg成猫幼猫通用粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">通用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">鲜肉</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">鲜肉配方，全年龄段猫咪适用</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>529</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"product-card\" data-id=\"17\">\n    <div class=\"pc-img-wrap\">\n      <img src=\"/api/images/goods/mock_good.jpg\" alt=\"网易严选全价猫粮2kg成猫增肥发腮粮\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pc-info\">\n      <div class=\"pc-name\">网易严选全价猫粮2kg成猫增肥发腮粮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-tag-row\">\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">猫用</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">热销</span>\n        <span class=\"pc-tag\">增肥</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pc-desc\">高肉含量，助猫咪增肥发腮</div>\n      <div class=\"pc-bottom\">\n        <span class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-unit\">¥</span>88</span>\n        <button class=\"pc-add-cart\">🛒 查看详情</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n## 其他猫粮选择\n\n除了以上品牌猫粮，我们还提供多种**经济实惠**的选择：\n\n- **大包装猫粮**：10斤装仅需¥9.66起，适合多猫家庭或流浪猫喂养\n- **试吃装猫粮**：半斤/1斤小包装，价格¥3.88起，方便尝试不同口味\n- **冻干猫粮**：高蛋白配方，价格¥4.90起，营养更丰富\n\n## 选购建议\n\n如果您需要更具体的推荐，可以告诉我：\n1. **猫咪年龄**（幼猫/成猫/老年猫）\n2. **特殊需求**（美毛、增肥、低敏、去泪痕等）\n3. **预算范围**\n\n我可以为您提供更精准的推荐！🐱', 'assistant');
